<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Go Concurrency on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/series/go-concurrency/</link><description>Recent content in Go Concurrency on Quy Duong Minh — Software Engineer</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi-VN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://quydmfl.github.io/series/go-concurrency/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>01. Goroutines</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/01-goroutines/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/01-goroutines/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Mở đầu mini-series Concurrency: &lt;a href="../../fundamentals/"&gt;mini-series Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt; kết thúc bằng bài học &amp;ldquo;chia sẻ dữ liệu giữa nhiều goroutine cần đồng bộ tường minh&amp;rdquo;. Bài này bắt đầu từ chính đơn vị đó — goroutine — chi phí thật của nó, và lỗi phổ biến nhất: goroutine leak.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="goroutine-rẻ-hơn-os-thread-bao-nhiêu-thật-sự"&gt;Goroutine rẻ hơn OS thread bao nhiêu, thật sự&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Goroutine bắt đầu với stack rất nhỏ (khoảng 2KB, so với vài MB mặc định của OS thread), tự động grow khi cần — đây là lý do tạo được hàng trăm nghìn goroutine mà không cạn RAM. Đo thật bằng cách tạo 100.000 goroutine cùng lúc:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>02. Channels</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/02-channels/</link><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/02-channels/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../01-goroutines/"&gt;Bài 01&lt;/a&gt; tạo ra goroutine — bài này đi vào cách chúng giao tiếp với nhau: channel. &amp;ldquo;Don&amp;rsquo;t communicate by sharing memory; share memory by communicating&amp;rdquo; — triết lý cốt lõi của Go concurrency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="unbuffered-channel-gửi-và-nhận-đồng-bộ-hoá-lẫn-nhau"&gt;Unbuffered channel: gửi và nhận đồng bộ hoá lẫn nhau&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; make(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;chan&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;go&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;goroutine: chuẩn bị gửi&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Sleep&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;300&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Millisecond&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ch&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;xong việc&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;goroutine: đã gửi xong&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;main: gọi &amp;lt;-ch, sẽ BLOCK&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;ch&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;main: nhận được:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;06:14:27.711 main: gọi &amp;lt;-ch, sẽ BLOCK cho tới khi có người gửi
06:14:27.711 goroutine: chuẩn bị gửi
06:14:28.012 goroutine: đã gửi xong
06:14:28.012 main: nhận được: xong việc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Timestamp &lt;code&gt;28.012&lt;/code&gt; xuất hiện đồng thời ở cả 2 dòng cuối&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;code&gt;main&lt;/code&gt; nhận được đúng ngay khoảnh khắc goroutine gửi xong, không sớm hơn, không muộn hơn. Đây chính là bản chất unbuffered channel: gửi (&lt;code&gt;ch &amp;lt;- v&lt;/code&gt;) &lt;strong&gt;block cho tới khi có người nhận&lt;/strong&gt;, và ngược lại — cơ chế đồng bộ hoá tự nhiên, không cần thêm &lt;code&gt;sync.Mutex&lt;/code&gt; cho nhiều trường hợp.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>03. Select statement</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/03-select-statement/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/03-select-statement/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../02-channels/"&gt;Bài 02&lt;/a&gt; học cách 1 channel hoạt động. Bài này đi vào &lt;code&gt;select&lt;/code&gt; — cách làm việc với &lt;strong&gt;nhiều&lt;/strong&gt; channel cùng lúc, và cách thoát khỏi tình huống có thể deadlock bằng timeout thay vì chờ vô thời hạn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="select-cơ-bản-chờ-nhiều-channel-xử-lý-cái-nào-sẵn-sàng-trước"&gt;select cơ bản: chờ nhiều channel, xử lý cái nào sẵn sàng trước&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fast&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; make(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;chan&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;slow&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; make(&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;chan&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;go&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Sleep&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;100&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Millisecond&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fast&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;fast xong&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;go&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;() {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Sleep&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;400&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;*&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Millisecond&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;slow&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;slow xong&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}()
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt; &amp;lt; &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;i&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;++&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;select&lt;/span&gt; {
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fast&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;nhận từ fast:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#66d9ef"&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#f92672"&gt;&amp;lt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;slow&lt;/span&gt;:
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Now&lt;/span&gt;().&lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;Format&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;15:04:05.000&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;), &lt;span style="color:#e6db74"&gt;&amp;#34;nhận từ slow:&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style="color:#a6e22e"&gt;msg&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; }
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;06:18:04.484 nhận từ fast: fast xong
06:18:04.784 nhận từ slow: slow xong&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chênh lệch đúng 300ms&lt;/strong&gt; giữa 2 dòng — khớp chính xác với &lt;code&gt;400ms - 100ms&lt;/code&gt;. &lt;code&gt;select&lt;/code&gt; block cho tới khi &lt;strong&gt;ít nhất 1&lt;/strong&gt; channel sẵn sàng, luôn xử lý đúng channel có dữ liệu trước — không cần code polling hay kiểm tra tuần tự từng channel.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>04. sync package</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/04-sync-package/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/04-sync-package/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../03-select-statement/"&gt;Bài 03&lt;/a&gt; dùng channel để multiplex và đồng bộ hoá. Nhưng không phải lúc nào channel cũng là công cụ tự nhiên nhất — nhiều bài toán chỉ cần &amp;ldquo;bảo vệ 1 biến dùng chung&amp;rdquo; hoặc &amp;ldquo;chờ N goroutine xong việc&amp;rdquo;, và &lt;code&gt;sync&lt;/code&gt; package giải quyết gọn hơn hẳn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="mutex--bảo-vệ-shared-state-đơn-giản"&gt;Mutex — bảo vệ shared state đơn giản&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;counter++&lt;/code&gt; trông như 1 thao tác, nhưng thực chất là 3 bước: đọc giá trị, cộng 1, ghi lại. 1000 goroutine cùng làm việc này trên cùng 1 biến, không có gì đồng bộ hoá:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>05. Worker Pool pattern</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/05-worker-pool-pattern/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/05-worker-pool-pattern/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="../04-sync-package/"&gt;Bài 04&lt;/a&gt; dùng &lt;code&gt;Mutex&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;WaitGroup&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;Once&lt;/code&gt; để bảo vệ và đồng bộ hoá trạng thái. Bài này ghép channel + goroutine + &lt;code&gt;sync&lt;/code&gt; lại thành 1 pattern thực chiến dùng nhiều nhất trong code Go production: &lt;strong&gt;worker pool&lt;/strong&gt; — giới hạn số goroutine chạy đồng thời cho 1 khối lượng công việc lớn, thay vì tạo goroutine không giới hạn cho mỗi job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="vì-sao-cần-giới-hạn-concurrency"&gt;Vì sao cần giới hạn concurrency&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;go func()&lt;/code&gt; rẻ để viết, nhưng không miễn phí để chạy — &lt;a href="../01-goroutines/"&gt;bài 01&lt;/a&gt; đã đo goroutine tốn thật ~606 byte mỗi cái. Tệ hơn cả bộ nhớ: nếu mỗi job còn gọi ra 1 service khác (database, API bên thứ 3), tạo 1 goroutine cho mỗi job trong 1 danh sách hàng nghìn phần tử nghĩa là bắn hàng nghìn kết nối đồng thời vào service đó — thứ dễ sập hơn nhiều so với chương trình Go của bạn.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>06. Race conditions</title><link>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/06-race-conditions/</link><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://quydmfl.github.io/articles/golang-series/concurrency/06-race-conditions/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Bài cuối mini-series Concurrency: tổng hợp lại các pattern gây race condition phổ biến nhất đã chạm qua rải rác từ &lt;a href="../01-goroutines/"&gt;bài 01&lt;/a&gt; tới &lt;a href="../05-worker-pool-pattern/"&gt;bài 05&lt;/a&gt;, lần này tập trung riêng vào công cụ phát hiện và cách sửa. Điểm chung của mọi pattern dưới đây: code &lt;strong&gt;trông có vẻ đúng&lt;/strong&gt; khi đọc, chỉ lộ ra khi chạy với &lt;code&gt;-race&lt;/code&gt; hoặc gặp đúng thời điểm hiếm trên production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="race-detector--race-phát-hiện-được-gì"&gt;Race detector: &lt;code&gt;-race&lt;/code&gt; phát hiện được gì&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block"&gt;
 &lt;button class="code-block__copy" type="button" data-copy-code data-copied-label="Copied"&gt;Copy&lt;/button&gt;
 &lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;go run -race .
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;go test -race ./...
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;go build -race -o app .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;-race&lt;/code&gt; chèn thêm code kiểm tra mọi truy cập bộ nhớ đồng thời (dùng thuật toán vector clock), chạy chậm hơn đáng kể — Go team ước tính thường chậm hơn 2-10 lần và tốn thêm bộ nhớ — nhưng phát hiện được chính xác &lt;strong&gt;race đã thực sự xảy ra&lt;/strong&gt; trong lần chạy đó, kể cả khi output cuối cùng &amp;ldquo;trông vẫn đúng&amp;rdquo;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>